      "live_title": "Personalized Byzantine Eagle Area Rug with Orthodox Cross for Meditation Space",
      "live_body_text": "<p>This personalized Orthodox Christian area rug features a traditional Russian Orthodox three-bar cross design inspired by Eastern Orthodox Christianity and Byzantine faith art. Ideal for home prayer corners, icon corners, monasteries, or quiet meditation spaces, this rug serves as a sacred addition to your home. Designed as a practical and custom prayer mat, it blends traditional religious heritage with modern functionality.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features the traditional Russian Orthodox three-bar cross symbol and Byzantine eagle.</li>\n<li>Supports customization for a personalized religious home decor experience.</li>\n<li>Constructed with a soft memory foam surface for comfortable underfoot support.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a practical non-slip backing to keep the rug securely in place.</li>\n<li>Versatile design suitable for living rooms, bedrooms, and dedicated prayer spaces.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non Slip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Classic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>Perfect for integration into your living room, bedroom, or a dedicated faith and prayer corner. It also fits beautifully in church spaces, monasteries, or hallway entrances for a welcoming, sacred touch.</p>",
